788
01:16:22.349 --> 01:16:25.922
You're gonna say I shouldn't be in the
cemetery in the middle of the night, right?

789
01:16:25.969 --> 01:16:27.908
Safest place in the world to be.

790
01:16:28.489 --> 01:16:32.548
It's 'cause everybody's dead.
I knew you'd come here.

791
01:16:34.019 --> 01:16:36.266
It's really late, Sarah.

792
01:16:36.313 --> 01:16:37.999
